2026-09-24T05:05:08.5477342Z 
2026-09-24T05:05:08.5477715Z A blocked or observed runtime action is not proof that the final software works.
2026-09-24T05:05:08.5478873Z DiffWitness verifies the resulting Git change independently. Source code and raw prompts/diffs stay local by default.
2026-09-24T05:05:08.5479475Z 
2026-09-24T05:05:08.5479786Z For every command and advanced workflow: `dw view technical`, then `dw --help`.
2026-09-24T05:05:08.5480213Z 
2026-09-24T05:05:08.5480909Z Language: English by default. Save with `dw language en|fr`; override once with `dw --language en|fr <command>`. OS locale never selects product language.
